      "writtenOn": "2024-10-10T00:19:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, I think I\u0027ll just use the `include_prefix` magic in [`cxx/BUILD.bazel.skia`](https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/909037/6/bazel/external/cxx/BUILD.bazel.skia#42) to avoid having to change anything on the Chromium side.  At least for now.  WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "f9c8a157_729c7363",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 24
      },
