      "message": "If you\u0027d like we can add a public_configs to cxx which adds `-I//third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/cxx-${cxx_version}/include` or something to `cflags`. Ideally it would be under a \"cxx/\" dir still, but that would put it as just \"cxx.h\". This is how we e.g. also deal with skia\u0027s own headers being in third_party/skia in chromium but not in skia.",
